{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the Underground Hell of Imorah</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The expansive realm of Imorah holds long imprisoned monsters and artifacts. Challengers journey from far and wide, but few reach the end to claim the treasure of immortality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trials of Imorah</strong> is a 2D action-adventure focused heavily on exploration. There are many paths to find and just as many secrets behind each twisted corner. Battle ferocious demons, solve dastardly puzzles, and meet other valiant champions trying to survive the depths forged by the gods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic 2D action with dozens of weapons and magical spells to fit your style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expansive platforming gameplay with a variety of movement options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a massive, underground world containing 10 unique, handcrafted levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of enemies with distinct behavior and weaknesses to exploit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Stray Souls! Gather enough and the remnants of failed challengers will power up your own capabilities with simple RPG mechanics!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip Runes! These arcane tools will modify your basic weapons with all sorts of effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elemental systems to make the world your weapon. Burn foliage, freeze water, and electrocute metal to slay foes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Side Quests with a Diverse Cast of Survivors, Fellow Challengers, and Lunatics. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vast, original soundtrack to aid the atmospheric adventure for hours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself with extra gameplay settings to amplify difficulty.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2337840?t=1760747251","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337840/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760747251","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337840/f476380a8ae8e33012182363ede058e82a4f8753/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760747251","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337840/f476380a8ae8e33012182363ede058e82a4f8753/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760747251","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the Underground Hell of Imorah</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The expansive realm of Imorah holds long imprisoned monsters and artifacts. Challengers journey from far and wide, but few reach the end to claim the treasure of immortality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trials of Imorah</strong> is a 2D action-adventure focused heavily on exploration. There are many paths to find and just as many secrets behind each twisted corner. Battle ferocious demons, solve dastardly puzzles, and meet other valiant champions trying to survive the depths forged by the gods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic 2D action with dozens of weapons and magical spells to fit your style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expansive platforming gameplay with a variety of movement options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a massive, underground world containing 10 unique, handcrafted levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of enemies with distinct behavior and weaknesses to exploit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Stray Souls! Gather enough and the remnants of failed challengers will power up your own capabilities with simple RPG mechanics!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip Runes! These arcane tools will modify your basic weapons with all sorts of effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elemental systems to make the world your weapon. Burn foliage, freeze water, and electrocute metal to slay foes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Side Quests with a Diverse Cast of Survivors, Fellow Challengers, and Lunatics. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vast, original soundtrack to aid the atmospheric adventure for hours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself with extra gameplay settings to amplify difficulty.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Floorium"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337840/a98c3399e756a447f88f498604eb9ede729d28e6/header.jpg?t=1760747251","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2337840/2143880233/722426aa72c891169e7296a2b5849d6448fa265c/1760745757/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760747250","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2337840/2143880233/722426aa72c891169e7296a2b5849d6448fa265c/1760745757/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760747250","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2337840/2143880233/722426aa72c891169e7296a2b5849d6448fa265c/1760745757/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760747250","id":256940936,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256940936/movie480.mp4?t=1760747250","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256940936/movie_max.mp4?t=1760747250"},"name":"Indev Trailer (2025)","thumbnail":"htt